{
  "name": "Call back missed calls automatically with a Ringee AI voice agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Missed call callback\nWhen someone calls your Ringee number and nobody answers, an AI voice agent calls them back a few minutes later, and every callback is logged in a Google Sheet.\n\nThe callback is placed **once per missed call**: the missed call's ID is the Idempotency Key.\n\n[Ringee](https://ringee.io) · [Docs](https://docs.ringee.io)",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 470,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d22a8a38-936a-5ded-93e6-6a93d506e24c",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Before you run this**\n1. In Ringee, create a **Custom Integration** (Integrations → Custom Integrations) and copy its **API key** and **Signing Secret**.\n2. In n8n, create a **Ringee API** credential with both.\n3. Pick your AI voice agent in the Ringee node.\n4. Activate the workflow, then paste the **Ringee Trigger's Production URL** into the integration's **Outbound URL** and tick *Call Missed*.\n\nUse an **Appointment Booking** agent. Create a sheet **Callback log** with columns `Time`, `Caller`, `Our number`, `Callback call`, `Reason`.\n\n**Callbacks are limited.** Each number is called back at most once every four hours, so a caller who rings ten times is not called ten times, and two Ringee numbers running this workflow cannot call each other back forever.",
        "height": 410,
        "width": 470,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "e6ccaca0-9fa4-5bd1-9999-ecbf9ce1df0f",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -50
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Consent**\nThe person phoned you first, which usually allows one callback. Check your local rules about calling back, and keep calls inside reasonable hours: the *Wait* node below delays the call, and you can add a time check before it.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "4184da7e-f71d-5979-92fa-3bef87cbffab",
      "name": "Consent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "call.missed"
        ],
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "31f2530e-bf13-5e9d-94fb-c36355f106ee",
      "name": "Missed call",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ringee.ringeeTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        -40
      ],
      "webhookId": "3e29fb2f-c4e9-5f04-95ee-97e89308a208"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 5,
        "unit": "minutes"
      },
      "id": "66030103-2dc9-5b62-ab19-a19cd88225c1",
      "name": "Wait 5 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        500,
        -40
      ],
      "webhookId": "f54f3a01-34b4-58ca-a67c-e6ea82a0f735"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "aiAgent",
        "operation": "startCall",
        "agentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "phoneNumber": "={{ $('Missed call').item.json.data.fromNumber }}",
        "variables": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "first_name": "there",
            "reason": "You called us a few minutes ago and we missed your call"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {
          "externalId": "={{ 'callback-' + $('Missed call').item.json.data.callId }}",
          "idempotencyKey": "={{ 'callback-' + String($('Missed call').item.json.data.fromNumber).replace(/[^\\d+]/g, '') + '-' + Math.floor($now.toMillis() / 14400000) }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "e2056cae-eb4a-503f-9ee9-5c4af730f995",
      "name": "Call them back",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ringee.ringee",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Time": "={{ $('Missed call').item.json.occurredAt }}",
            "Caller": "={{ $('Missed call').item.json.data.fromNumber }}",
            "Our number": "={{ $('Missed call').item.json.data.toNumber }}",
            "Callback call": "={{ $json.call_id }}",
            "Reason": "={{ $('Missed call').item.json.data.reason || 'Not answered' }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7c13d79a-6d57-5133-b112-a4067acc2bc1",
      "name": "Log the callback",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        980,
        -40
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Missed call": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Wait 5 minutes",
